          "id": "A",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "What makes quokkas smile all the time?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "It looks like the quokka is giving us a big smile."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "That is to say, they carry their babies in their "
            },
            {
              "t": "gloss",
              "v": "pouches",
              "zh": "育儿袋"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Because of its cute look and little smile, the quokka is called the happiest animal in the world."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Those places are beautiful and have good weather."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "F",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "A kangaroo has a special pouch which is like a warm house for their babies."
            }
          ]
        }
